                    "sense_definition": "Governed by self-interest, often sacrificing principles for short-term personal advantage.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "practicality",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "His decision was purely <w>expedient</w>, designed to protect his own career rather than do what was right."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "She made an <w>expedient</w> alliance with her rivals to secure her position in the company."
